   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Welcome To An Altered Future**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Alter Me II**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Altered Beast III**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Lonely Steel Sheet Flyer**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2017-10-07.mysteryjack** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 84 min [1]. Said about its sound: Han-Tyumi synth volume was very low during Welcome To An Altered Future and Han-Tyumi the Confused Cyborg [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Highway to Hell [1]\n- Band and house soundman Chris troubleshooted monitors; venue capacity was 300 with PA technical problems [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2017-10-07.mysteryjack**: taped by @mysterjackofficial; transferred by @mysteryjackofficial; source: Source: TASCAM DR-40 (Internal Cardioid Mics @ 24bit/48kHz WAV- FOB- XY Pattern- Deck mounted on a small ledge on the wall, house right. Approximately 20 feet… [1]",
